<title>USA: Morocco buys 42,000T opt-origin vegoil - exporters.</title>
<headline>Morocco buys 42,000T opt-origin vegoil - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco bought at least 42,000 tonnes of optional origin vegetable oil at $544.50 per tonne C and F early this week, U.S. export sources said.</p>
<p>They said 18,000 tonnes will be shipped in the first half of March, with 12,000 tonnes for arrival during the first half of April and 18,000 tonnes slated for the last half of April, sources said.</p>
<p>Morocco initially tendered for 66,000 tonnes of optional origin vegetable oil on Monday.</p>
<p>--Anna Driver and Doris Frankel 312-983-7294</p>
</text>
